# Environment files must never enter the build context. The Dockerfile uses
# explicit COPY paths (never `COPY . .`), so nothing leaks into the image today
# — this is defence in depth against that changing, and keeps secrets off the
# wire to the daemon. `npx prisma generate` (Dockerfile:50) does not need them.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
